  "action": "deliver_reel",
  "words": "Rita. It’s in your patch now. The audio track is clean, just like you asked. Don't ask me about '98. I'm done.",
  "intention": "Fulfill the request to hand over the recording immediately so Rita can use it, then disengage from the emotional weight of the situation.",
  "detail": "I walk over to the station line where the patch is glowing. I slot the reel into the input port, wait for the confirmation light to turn green, and then physically step back, leaving my hands in my pockets. I do not stay to watch or listen."
